{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>הניחה</b> Two times in the Masorah: הניחה לי / הניחה אותי. And ה. משני את העמודים גב. Shimshon — to tell you that he killed among them in his death more than he put to death in his lifetime, and this is הניחה לי / ויחר אפי בהם ואכלם — that he consumed them, and put to death among them all their officers:" "<b>ואכלם</b> Two times in the Masorah: one is דין and the other ואכלם ואמחצם. This is what they expounded: there is no פרוענות that does not contain retribution from the incident of the calf:" "<b>ואעשה אותך</b> plene with vav — that from you will come forth six hundred thousand:"], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {0 "The phrases 'ה. משני את העמודים גב.' and 'שמשון' are obscure; 'גב.' may be an abbreviation, possibly for גבורה. The antecedent of 'he' (Shimshon/Samson) and the connection to the verse are unclear. Transmitted hyper-literally.", 1 "'דין' appears to label the first occurrence as belonging to the attribute of justice; 'פרוענות' (from פרע, to let loose/abandon) is rendered hyper-literally."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:14:58.753281078Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}